      "role": "user",
      "content": "the unit seems to have just cut out without any error codes on the dashboard. it was working fine ten minutes ago then just died. it feels like something is physically interfering with the motor or the electrical circuit. what could cause a sudden, complete failure like that in a unit that was just recently serviced?",
